Frank macOS installation

Use full/MACOS-INSTALL.md or lite/MACOS-INSTALL.md for current builds.
The version-checked helper only removes quarantine from the selected app.
It does not require sudo, re-sign the app, or disable system security.

Download the helper from the matching release and run its --check mode first.
The old frank-2.dmg.zip is retained as a legacy download.
